{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Eight Prized Flowers are said to be very hard to find on the little island where May lives. Even so, she wants to find one of each...and create the most amazing bouquet for her mom's birthday! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find them all, she must explore the island,  avoid shadowy creatures, solve puzzles, meet new people, and collect whatever useful things she can find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play how you want! Check the map to see where to go. Or wing it and discover the world on your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics and audio inspired by retro handheld consoles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All art, music, code, and text are 100% human-made with love and care.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo-developed indie game made with the open-source Godot game engine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free to play! The entire adventure, from beginning to end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to come! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The overworld is  sliced up like a jigsaw puzzle, with each piece having its purpose, and each destination just a few pieces away. As you explore, your map will fill in where you've been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/01f770985e4e6c702946d88520cfa60f.poster.avif?t=1768173080\" aria-label=\"A parchment paper of an ingame map is shown. The map then closes. The protagonist is standing in a grassy field, then walks south and enters a library building.\" width=320 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/01f770985e4e6c702946d88520cfa60f.webm?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/01f770985e4e6c702946d88520cfa60f.mp4?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avoid Shadowy Creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild creatures won't kill you, but they will inconvenience you. May is no warrior; she has no weapon. Instead, she must jump, whistle, outmaneuver and outsmart obstacles to proceed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/948f9d450ad3d532c58dfbcca95a0f98.poster.avif?t=1768173080\" aria-label=\"The protagonist walks through a teal pine tree forest. She whistles at an enemy, briefly stunning it. Then she hops over a second enemy, and moves past it.\" width=320 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/948f9d450ad3d532c58dfbcca95a0f98.webm?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/948f9d450ad3d532c58dfbcca95a0f98.mp4?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From time to time, the terrain of the island itself will get in your way. That's okay. Assess the situation and figure out what must be done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/58c86cc2b62cb89095aa6306a501ec32.poster.avif?t=1768173080\" aria-label=\"The protagonist is standing in a sandy cave. She is shown whistling at 8 glass orbs arranged in a circle. When a whistle hits one, a musical note appears inside it and the two adjacent to it. If notes are already present, then they disappear.\" width=320 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/58c86cc2b62cb89095aa6306a501ec32.webm?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/58c86cc2b62cb89095aa6306a501ec32.mp4?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet New People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All kinds of people have made their home on the island. They may have some item or information that you need. You never know unless you ask!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/4bfd35e205d6b72e546ed89257568618.poster.avif?t=1768173080\" width=320 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/4bfd35e205d6b72e546ed89257568618.mp4?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Stuff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many optional collectibles to find. Lesser flowers, beehives, and more. Some aren't easy to get. Players feeling up for a challenge can try to collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/8236e516e3ed66957d42330cd5b07e41.poster.avif?t=1768173080\" aria-label=\"The protagonist is walking through a green garden area with tall hedges. She walks over to a sparkling blue flower and holds it over her head. The text reads, &amp;quot;I found Cornflowers! They&#039;re sooooo blue-tiful. Ahaha.&amp;quot;\" width=320 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/8236e516e3ed66957d42330cd5b07e41.webm?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/8236e516e3ed66957d42330cd5b07e41.mp4?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming Soon!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>May and the Amazing Bouquet</i> is currently in development and will release at a future date!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like what you see, Add It to Your Wishlist so you'll be notified when it releases!  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734760?t=1768173080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/6b13878bcdbab630b4d4a77b5a2507edb620452e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768173080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/8110a79d0b7c3ae1c87310dffda8b575b98eea6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768173080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/8110a79d0b7c3ae1c87310dffda8b575b98eea6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768173080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Eight Prized Flowers are said to be very hard to find on the little island where May lives. Even so, she wants to find one of each...and create the most amazing bouquet for her mom's birthday! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find them all, she must explore the island,  avoid shadowy creatures, solve puzzles, meet new people, and collect whatever useful things she can find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play how you want! Check the map to see where to go. Or wing it and discover the world on your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics and audio inspired by retro handheld consoles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All art, music, code, and text are 100% human-made with love and care.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo-developed indie game made with the open-source Godot game engine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free to play! The entire adventure, from beginning to end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to come! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The overworld is  sliced up like a jigsaw puzzle, with each piece having its purpose, and each destination just a few pieces away. As you explore, your map will fill in where you've been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/01f770985e4e6c702946d88520cfa60f.poster.avif?t=1768173080\" aria-label=\"A parchment paper of an ingame map is shown. The map then closes. The protagonist is standing in a grassy field, then walks south and enters a library building.\" width=320 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/01f770985e4e6c702946d88520cfa60f.webm?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/01f770985e4e6c702946d88520cfa60f.mp4?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avoid Shadowy Creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild creatures won't kill you, but they will inconvenience you. May is no warrior; she has no weapon. Instead, she must jump, whistle, outmaneuver and outsmart obstacles to proceed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/948f9d450ad3d532c58dfbcca95a0f98.poster.avif?t=1768173080\" aria-label=\"The protagonist walks through a teal pine tree forest. She whistles at an enemy, briefly stunning it. Then she hops over a second enemy, and moves past it.\" width=320 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/948f9d450ad3d532c58dfbcca95a0f98.webm?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/948f9d450ad3d532c58dfbcca95a0f98.mp4?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From time to time, the terrain of the island itself will get in your way. That's okay. Assess the situation and figure out what must be done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/58c86cc2b62cb89095aa6306a501ec32.poster.avif?t=1768173080\" aria-label=\"The protagonist is standing in a sandy cave. She is shown whistling at 8 glass orbs arranged in a circle. When a whistle hits one, a musical note appears inside it and the two adjacent to it. If notes are already present, then they disappear.\" width=320 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/58c86cc2b62cb89095aa6306a501ec32.webm?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/58c86cc2b62cb89095aa6306a501ec32.mp4?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet New People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All kinds of people have made their home on the island. They may have some item or information that you need. You never know unless you ask!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/4bfd35e205d6b72e546ed89257568618.poster.avif?t=1768173080\" width=320 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/4bfd35e205d6b72e546ed89257568618.mp4?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Stuff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many optional collectibles to find. Lesser flowers, beehives, and more. Some aren't easy to get. Players feeling up for a challenge can try to collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/8236e516e3ed66957d42330cd5b07e41.poster.avif?t=1768173080\" aria-label=\"The protagonist is walking through a green garden area with tall hedges. She walks over to a sparkling blue flower and holds it over her head. The text reads, &amp;quot;I found Cornflowers! They&#039;re sooooo blue-tiful. Ahaha.&amp;quot;\" width=320 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/8236e516e3ed66957d42330cd5b07e41.webm?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/extras/8236e516e3ed66957d42330cd5b07e41.mp4?t=1768173080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming Soon!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>May and the Amazing Bouquet</i> is currently in development and will release at a future date!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like what you see, Add It to Your Wishlist so you'll be notified when it releases!  </p>","developers":["MicalPixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734760/3bd2afa0944875419e1c8f90c5efd57cb25b2efd/header.jpg?t=1768173080","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3734760/210917545/62d78622edbb84fd1a403e91c28c3aac67ab2a8c/1759061555/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759062843","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3734760/210917545/62d78622edbb84fd1a403e91c28c3aac67ab2a8c/1759061555/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759062843","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3734760/210917545/62d78622edbb84fd1a403e91c28c3aac67ab2a8c/1759061555/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759062843","id":257194056,"name":"Sneak Peak Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194056/fcf0f725822b435ebc897218bb0263a51bcfe5ca/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759062843"}],"name":"May and the Amazing Bouquet","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel 8th Gen i5-8260U<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["MicalPixel"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia fantasiosa","ratin